        "id": 1085182
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-21T09:09:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do you think about:\n\n1. --voteable-on-ref\n2. --permitted-voting-ref\n3. --filter-by-ref\n\n?",
      "parentUuid": "6184e22a_57c76426",
